OL,3,GNEWSATrouble at the top - the crisis of
OL,4,Aconfidence in Scotland's NHS leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe verdict from Scotland's healthcare
OL,7,Fwatchdog on NHS Grampian could hardly
OL,8,Fhave been more damning.
OL,10,FMajor problems at Dr Gray's Hospital in
OL,11,FElgin, but deficiencies stretching
OL,12,Facross the whole region, a failure to
OL,13,Flearn from mistakes and "recurring
OL,14,Fpatterns of harm".
OL,16,FThursday's report from Health
OL,17,FImprovement Scotland is more evidence
OL,18,Fthat frontline NHS staff feel they are
OL,19,Fcarrying the can for poor leadership by
OL,20,Fhighly-paid, powerful people at the top
OL,21,Fof Scotland's health boards.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
