OL,3,GNEWSATrouble at the top - the crisis of
OL,4,Aconfidence in Scotland's NHS leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FCentre stage this time is chief
OL,7,Fexecutive Laura Skaife-Knight, who
OL,8,Fearns between #170,000 and #175,000 a
OL,9,Fyear. She ordered this review, but does
OL,10,Fnot escape blame.
